      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Absolutely needed.\n\nWhether it's just testing or regular switching between VR/Desktop for casual hanging out, it's super annoying if you have to settle on the \"worst\" config for either platform, at which one will then just constantly overactivate.\n\nAlways having to change it between each switch is really annoying.",
