      "mergeID": "64cacbfaaaf9d289ff2589d0",
      "mergedPostDetails": "For those switching between VR and Desktop playing, one will nearly always have 2 different audio devices for either mode which will require different settings.\n\nThe game should remember the volume and treshhold settings individually per input device, so you can configure your desktop and your vr one separately and do not have to adjust them every time you switch.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Save individual microphone volume and threshold per device.",
