  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-03T13:14:35.918Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen using multiple HMDs or just switching between Desktop and VR it's possible that you want to use different setting for the microphone threshold and volume per input device. This can be quite annoying to do though, since you have to readjust them every time you switch input devices, as they aren't saved on a per input device basis.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nSave Microphone Volume and Threshold Settings on a per input device basis. This makes it easier for people who use multiple input devices to have different settings depending on what device they are using.",
